<div class="search-page">
  <h1>Parliamentary Search</h1>

  <p>Parliamentary Search provides access to parliamentary material from multiple sources, including debates, written questions and answers, and other parliamentary business.</p>

  <h2>Search Tools</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://search-material.parliament.uk/">Search Materials</a> - for all users</li>
    <li><a href="https://search.parliament.uk/">Parliamentary Search</a> - for internal users only</li>
  </ul>

  <p>A beta preview of the unified search experience is available at <a href="https://beta-search.parliament.uk/">beta-search.parliament.uk</a>.</p>

  <h2>Development</h2>
  <p>Application development is tracked on a <a href="https://trello.com/b/parliamentary-search">Trello Board</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For questions or feedback, email <a href="mailto:parliamentarysearch@parliament.uk">parliamentarysearch@parliament.uk</a>.</p>
</div>
